    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "You sound like you're used to this.",
            27
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "It's only natural. They're just ordinary people with emotions. Just because I saved them doesn't mean they'll suddenly have a change of heart.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "I don't expect them to be grateful or see me as a savior... As long as they can find their way back onto the right path, that would be enough.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "I'm the one who should be apologizing for dragging you into this mess today.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Don't worry. I didn't come here for their gratitude, either.",
            31
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe has been driving for hours without rest. The weak light from the headlights barely illuminates his face, making his expression unreadable."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Despite this, Watanabe's tone shows no signs of fatigue. He recounts the day's events as if it were just another ordinary day."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "If I wanted gratitude, hearing thanks from comrades like you would be enough.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "Even if they did thank me, I wouldn't know if it was sincere or just politeness.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "I saved them for my own peace of mind, so how they feel is irrelevant.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "But you... you're different. You came here, risking your life, because you trust me.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Watanabe",
            "My persistence has value as long as you trust me and believe in what I'm doing.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Of course it is valuable.",
            39
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "You also mentioned that many of them aren't bad people, only desperate people.",
            40
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "And you saved them, giving them another choice.",
